 locationScope:['Location scope','Which store(s) or units this local SOP is intended to control.','Store 104 only; All company locations; Stores 101, 104 and 118'],
 reviewTrigger:['Early review trigger','Events that should cause management to review the SOP before the normal review date.','New equipment, process change, code change, repeated failure or incident'],
 acknowledgementRequired:['Acknowledgment requirement','Whether affected roles should acknowledge the approved version or revision.','Yes — hosts acknowledge Rev 2.0 before next scheduled shift'],
 trainingRecordLocation:['Training record location','Where evidence of training or acknowledgment is kept.','Manager training binder; HRIS; approved shared drive'],
 pilotTest:['Pilot / field test before approval','Optional note showing who tested the SOP in real operations and what was learned before approval.','Tested on Friday dinner by MOD and two servers; step 4 timing revised'],
